## 3. Shape preview

The `shape:` block that will end up in `specs/services/{{ slug }}.yaml`. Each key is a yes/no decision based on the project's needs. Defaults below match the `python-api` template — change values for your project, or comment a line out to inherit the template default.

```yaml
shape:
  kind: service                 # service | worker | static | wordpress
  is_public: true               # exposes a public HTTPS endpoint?
  is_admin_dashboard: false     # has a UI behind Authelia 2FA?
  has_bearer_api: false         # uses X-Internal-Token for M2M calls?
  has_persistent_data: false    # needs Backrest backups of a volume?
  needs_database: false         # uses postgres-main (shared)?
  needs_cache: false            # uses redis-main (logical DB index)?
  has_search_feature: false     # uses meilisearch?
  exposes_metrics: true         # /metrics endpoint for Prometheus scrape?
  has_error_tracking: true      # GlitchTip project + SENTRY_DSN injection?
```

