## 9. Notes (VPS1 inventory reminders)

**These reminders are pre-loaded so the project's eventual AI guardrails stay grounded. Agents reading this preplan should treat them as ground truth.**

- **Database:** `postgres-main:5432` — shared Postgres on the `fabrik` Docker network. DB name = `{{ slug | replace('-', '_') }}` (auto-created by the postgres registrar if `shape.needs_database: true`). Never `localhost`.
- **Cache:** `redis-main:6379` — shared Redis; one logical DB index per service, allocated via `/opt/monitoring/configs/redis/assignments.json`. Never `localhost`.
- **M2M auth:** every internal Fabrik microservice validates `X-Internal-Token` against `SERVICE_INTERNAL_SECRET_KEY` (already in `/opt/fabrik/.env`). One key, one header, every service.
- **Public health:** `*.vps1.ocoron.com → /health` is universally Authelia-bypassed; expose `/health` returning HTTP 200 (real DB ping, not just `OK`).
- **Metrics:** if `shape.exposes_metrics: true`, Prometheus scrapes `<service>:8000/metrics`. The scaffolded `metrics.py` already emits the standard `<service>_requests_total` + `_request_duration_seconds_*` series.
- **Error tracking:** if `shape.has_error_tracking: true`, the orchestrator creates a GlitchTip project + injects `SENTRY_DSN` automatically. SDK ingestion goes to `http://glitchtip-web:8000` (internal alias), NOT the public `errors.vps1.ocoron.com`.

